ing":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zAWkb4fkNZZ28xbhh3uHCOoNcYa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zAWkb4fkNZZ28xbhh3uHCOoNcYa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"791876","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"La senpai Fuyumi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"休暇がとれたちせは水族館でシュウジと休息を楽しんだ。だが、二人の前にカワハラが現れる。怒りを向けるシュウジを制し悲しい笑顔で去るちせ。その夜、シュウジはふゆみの住むアパートの前に立っていた…。恐怖の象徴。それが、戦場でのちせだった。苦しむちせはリョウヘイ、ナカムラそして、ふゆみの夫・テツと出会う。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ToSlCE3Vw3t6USmm7fLi288DFq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ToSlCE3Vw3t6USmm7fLi288DFq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"791877","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Bugiardo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tetsu follows Chise command, unflinchingly pointing his rifle directly at Chise's head, but stops after she voices her desire to live. In school, Chise senses an earthquake and Shuji desperately takes her outside the classroom so she can transform in secret. When the military helicopter picks her up, Shuji shouts to Chise to meet him tonight at the observatory.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g0NevZ3Zh319tTKqu77At1mNq37.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g0NevZ3Zh319tTKqu77At1mNq37.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"791878","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Compagni di classe","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chise decides that they'd be better off as regular classmates, when she finds out that Shuji was once again in Fuyumi's house, breaking his promise to her. Atsushi reveals that he wants to join the military to protect the girl he loves, Akemi.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9DWs8OHXGpNtVxpltGbEhVEvT7p.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9DWs8OHXGpNtVxpltGbEhVEvT7p.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"791879","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Quello che voglio proteggere","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"敵の再来による危機を救ったちせ。シュウジは｢兵器｣としてのちせ、戦争という現実。それらをうまく理解できない自分に腹を立てる。そんな折、シュウジは公園で一人たたずむちせを見つけ、水族館へ行こうと約束するのだが…。一方、軍に入隊したアツシは兵士たちが口にする｢ちせ｣という単語の意味がわからずにいた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k0668s2uvnBSzLCXSTQfmneC2ED.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k0668s2uvnBSzLCXSTQfmneC2ED.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"791880","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Tutti cambiano","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"膠着状態が続く戦場で、ちせは再びテツと出会う。テツの隠れ家で安息を得るちせ。街では生き残りの白人兵狩りが行われ、タケを失い、すっかり変わってしまったゆかりは白人兵狩りに参加。ゆかりは密かにタケの仇を討とうとしていた。その最中シュウジは戦場にいたアツシについてアケミと語り合うのだが…大地震が起きる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8mXDwlz7N6GPqwsyTeFSqhpSCmy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8mXDwlz7N6GPqwsyTeFSqhpSCmy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"791881","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Akemi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chise didn't have maintenance for at least two days, and her physical condition has grown worse. Satomi begs Shuji to come to Akemi's room because she has been fatally injured...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qdLTVg2u6VtnG0mjzsoKjtNbieZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qdLTVg2u6VtnG0mjzsoKjtNbieZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"791882","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"E poi...","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chise holds Tetsu as he slowly dies. Akemi's father gives away party materials, and the school starts to prepare for a Summer festival, but the military wants to cancel it. Chise comes back with Shuji, and the pair happily run off together.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/baaBxaQrAC8kFPrSonuipnH0QGx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/baaBxaQrAC8kFPrSonuipnH0QGx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"791883","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Un po' di tempo solo per noi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"見渡す限り冬の大地。ちせとシュウジは海の見える街に辿り着き、ひっそりと暮らし始める。すべてを投げ打った二人は半壊したアパートで幸せな時を過ごしていた。だが、メンテナンスを受けられないちせの身体は蝕まれていく。そんな時、カワハラがちせとシュウジの前に現れて…。シュウジはカワハラを前に重大な決断をする。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g25mXsYOQnYM1xVnW3Tm538LCGR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g25mXsYOQnYM1xVnW3Tm538LCGR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"791884","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Canzone d'amore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chise has lost her ability to speak and her mental and physical condition has deteriorated gravely. Shuji desperately calls for Kawahara to take her back and save her, but he warns Shuji that Chise will never be the same again. Shuji discovers Chise's exchange diary, and in it there's one simple request for him: To go back to the place where they first kissed.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-09-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r3Jk7RpxtN0M9NZ3lXiBl0xKJzW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r3Jk7RpxtN0M9NZ3lXiBl0xKJzW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"791885","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"E poi, noi continueremo ad amare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"展望台。それはシュウジとちせの約束の地であった。何度も激しく求めあった一夜が明け、シュウジとちせは語りあう。死に行く者を讃えるように星の歴史を一つ一つ暗証し、この星の終わりをシュウジに告げる。戦闘機の大群が現れると、ちせはこの街を最期まで守るとシュウジに約束し、飛び立った。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-09-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dgMhUzYoO1SolF6lE0hS2tZYlib.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dgMhUzYoO1SolF6lE0hS2tZYlib.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1/episode/13"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34771/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793435877367,"status":"ok","r